sequenceDiagram
  participant Client
  participant API
  participant Worker as RQ Worker
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  Client->>API: POST /tdrs/{id}/match
  API-->>Client: 202 Accepted
  API->>Worker: enqueue matching job
  loop each expert position
    Worker->>DB: shortlist_candidates (pgvector top-30, rerank)
    Worker->>Worker: normalize_position_skills (once)
    loop each shortlisted candidate
      Worker->>Worker: normalize_cv_skills
      Worker->>Worker: check_hard_filters
      Worker->>Worker: score_soft_criteria
    end
    Worker->>DB: delete stale + insert fresh MatchResults
  end
  Client->>API: GET /tdrs/{id}/match-status (poll)
  Client->>API: GET /positions/{id}/matches
  API-->>Client: ranked shortlist per position
